DESCRIPTION:Alex Ligertwood was a powerhouse Scottish vocalist best known f
 
or his years as the lead singer of Santana\, where his soulful voice became
 
 a defining part of the band's sound throughout the 1980s. Blending rock\, 
 
blues\, soul\, R&B\, and Latin influences\, he also performed with acclaime
 
d artists and groups such as the Average White Band\, Brian Auger's Oblivio
 
n Express\, and the Jeff Beck Group. Join us at Catalina Jazz Club for a sp
 
ecial Celebration of Life honoring his extraordinary musical legacy\, unfor
 
gettable voice\, and lasting impact on generations of musicians and fans. "
 
Chuck Kavooras's All Stars" Tony Lindsey - Vocals Jimmy "Z" Zavalla - Vocal
 
s\, Harp\, Sax Mark Van Holmes - Vocals Teddy "Zig-Zag" Andreadis - Vocals 
 
